CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model reg:observe --mmio-weak --mmio-early-ack
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
the write has completed after the barrier: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Early acknowledgement (--mmio-early-ack): a lightweight fence is an ordering
barrier (ARM DMB) that does not complete posted writes. The write to reg may
therefore still be in flight after the barrier, so the assertion that it has
landed can fail. Compare dsb.desc, where a full fence (DSB) completes the write.
